+/*
+ * Gain model handed to the AE, one entry per index of the vendor sensor
+ * driver's gain table (the V4L2 analogue-gain control value; the sensor
+ * writes {coarse, fine} = {index>>8, index&0xff} through its own table).
+ *
+ * The values are the vendor sensor_again_lut gain column verbatim:
+ * log2(gain) in Q16, i.e. 0 = 1x, 65536 = 2x, 131072 = 4x ... 327680 = 32x.
